// expect: same: id|reverse: 1|\x010000;11|;255|\xff0000;3000|\xb80b00
// expect: same: count|count|min: 3000|2728|\x000100
// expect: same: to_number|to_number|to_number|to_number|to_number|to_number|to_number|to_number|to_number: 1994|14|4|14|3999|14|5|14|990
