// expect: same: sum|avg|pg_typeof|pg_typeof: 1 day 05:00:00|14:30:00|interval|interval
// expect: same: avg: 16 days
// expect: same: sum|avg: |
// expect: same: k|sum|avg|count: k0|11648:00:00|23:55:04.312115|487;k1|12180:00:00|25:03:42.222222|486;k2|11662:00:00|23:59:45.185185|486;k3|12144:00:00|24:59:15.555556|486;k4|11660:00:00|23:56:33.01848|487;k5|12179:00:00|25:00:29.568789|487;|2027:00:00|25:01:28.888889|81
